{
  "reason_by_group": {
    "pi-eof-column": "The end-of-file error in the processing instruction data state is detected when EOF is consumed, which is one column past the last character (as in every other eof-in-* test in the suite, e.g. '<?a' -> col 4 and '<!--' tests). The suite records column 4, the column after the target, for every input of the form '<?X X' or '<?X X?'. Spec: 'Processing instruction data state', EOF entry. Remove these entries when upstream fixes the data; the harness fails if an entry no longer matches the suite."
